  "body": "Looking for the ultimate lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, a smart first step on the property ladder, or a stylish, low-maintenance haven for your next stage of life? This immaculate townhouse delivers on every front!\r\n\r\nStep inside to a bright, open-plan sanctuary designed for modern living and seamless entertaining. The sleek kitchen flows effortlessly into the dining and living spaces, creating a warm, inviting hub. Enjoy the bonus of dual outdoor living - step out onto your front balcony to take in the vibe, or relax and unwind on the private rear deck. Tucked smartly under the stairs, you’ll also find a clever, out-of-sight laundry cupboard.\r\n\r\nHead upstairs to discover three well-proportioned bedrooms and a full family bathroom. The master bedroom serves as your personal retreat, complete with its own private ensuite and serene views out toward the estuary - the perfect vista to wake up to.\r\n\r\nNo stress over parking here! This home comes complete with two secure basement carparks plus access to a dedicated bike locking area, keeping your vehicle and gear safe and sound.\r\n\r\nPositioned right in the heart of the Millwater community, this home has it all on your doorstep. Grab your morning coffee from local cafes, take a peaceful stroll or bike ride along the popular Orewa Estuary Walkway, or head just minutes down the road to Silverdale Shopping Mall, local schools, and world-class local beaches. Plus, with quick access to the Northern Motorway, commuting is a breeze.\r\n\r\nWhether you're starting out, slowing down, or looking for an effortless lifestyle upgrade, this one is an absolute must-see!",
